  "job_B3.4.57_20260920_210405": {
    "text": "We r\u00e6de\u00f0 on bocan \u00fe\u00e6t Nabugodonosor geheregode Jerusalem, & genam \u00fe\u00e6t Judeisce folc \u00fee he \u00fe\u00e6r\nAc \u00fea \u00fea, \u00fea sixtig wintre agane w\u00e6ren, \u00fea com Darius king, and gewann \u00fea ceastre Babilonie, & freode\nSume \u00fe\u00e6s folcas \u00fea gecerden to heora earde Jerusalem, & sume \u00feaget \u00fe\u00e6r b\u00e6ften bel\u00e6fden, \u00fea blissodan\nAc \u00fea \u00fea hundseofontig geare w\u00e6ron fullice agane, \u00fea com sum o\u00f0er king Cyrus gen\u00e6mned, & let\n\u00deas hundseofentig gearen betacnige\u00f0 \u00fea seofon elden \u00feysses lifes, fram \u00fean time \u00fee Adam of Paradis\nFor \u00feonne we cume\u00f0 to fullfremedre blisse mid sawlen & mid lichamen, seo elde \u00fee we nu lytle \u00e6t",
